		<h5>last updated: 10-mar-2026</h5>
    <p>Q: why does your website have this domain and why do pages look like this??<br>
		A: domain part: i saw .rip domain online one day and thought of ame (nso). i think they (.rip and ame) go together pretty well. and i find myself in ame and ame in myself.<br>
		graphics part: naturally followed from domain part
    </p>
			<p>Q: what are your hobbies/interests?<br>
			cooking and even more baking. in my free time i play something from the library. i also like classical music, here are some of my picks (that are on my daily rotation):<br>

				- Prokofiev piano concertos 1-5 and symphonies 1, 5<br>
				- Rachmaninoff piano concertos 1-4 and preludes <br>
				- Handel's organ concertos 1-6 (not actually in rotation, i just like the organ)<br>
				- Rite of Spring, Firebird, Scheherazade (one of my favourite orchestra(l) pieces) and Köçekçe<br>
				- Swan Lake, Nutcracker, Also sprach Zarathustra<br>
				- Chopin's etudes (both sets) and rondos<br>
				- Liszt's 12 Transendental etudes (no 6. - Vision is my favourite piano piece outside of concertos ^^, but all 12 of them are amazing)<br>
				- Mendelsohn's violin concerto op. 64<br><br>

				there are some other (classical) pieces that i like but listing all of them would be tiring.. perhaps we could discuss them, hmm?
			</p>
			<p>
        this concludes qa page, might add/remove entries in the future
    </p>
</main>
